Z||000009||William Federle||11-16-1999||08:38 PM||||What is it - open season on Fieros?<BR>When I went outside to get in my Fiero to <BR>go to work this morning I noticed that the<BR>front was very high off of the ground - then<BR>I noticed that the front wheels were missing<BR>- then I saw the concrete blocks under the <BR>frame - then the missing rear wheels. Those<BR>wheels were one of the better parts of that<BR>car - aluminum with the word "Pontiac" on <BR>them. It seems crazy for that inexpensive<BR>(up to now) of a car, but I'm seriously <BR>contemplating an alarm system with a motion<BR>sensor.||||reg||9
