Z||000013||ChadMan||11-17-1999||08:54 AM||||William, that does suck, but there could be a silver lining in this for you if your Fiero is insured against theft/vandalism.  My local Pontiac dealer wants around $1300 for a set of 14x6 factory Fiero rims.<P>If you filed a claim, I'd say you could pick up a nice set of second-hand 14x6's for $250 or less, then pocket the difference or spend it on your baby.<P>Death to thieves and vandals.||||reg||1
