Z||000015||loafer87gt||11-17-1999||05:44 PM||||I finally got my GT back after someone stole it. I had it parked out in front of my street, and someone mangaged to slimjim their way inside. Ripped out CD and the trashed the whole center console, cracked open my steering column to hotwire the car, and smashed it into a curb or something wrecking the front end. The also took a crow bar and pried open my decklid to get my amplifier, cracking my wing in half. I almost cried when I went to the wrecking yard to pick up my recovered car. The stupid thing is is that the police refused to look into the theft claiming that it was just a bunch of minors and that it would be a waste of time to find them. What a crock.||||reg||1
